WEBVTT

00:07.867 --> 00:09.167
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.167 --> 00:10.967
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.967 --> 00:12.433
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.433 --> 00:14.600
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.600 --> 00:17.433
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.433 --> 00:19.533
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.533 --> 00:21.533
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.533 --> 00:23.433
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.433 --> 00:25.067
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.067 --> 00:27.567
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.567 --> 00:29.400
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.400 --> 00:31.500
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.500 --> 00:33.533
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.533 --> 00:35.400
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.400 --> 00:37.733
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.733 --> 00:39.667
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.667 --> 00:41.000
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.000 --> 00:42.867
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.867 --> 00:45.600
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.600 --> 00:47.633
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.633 --> 00:48.767
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:03.233 --> 01:05.067
- Ooh!
- 哦！

01:05.067 --> 01:08.067
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

01:08.067 --> 01:12.767
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:12.767 --> 01:13.767
[line trilling]
[行颤音]

01:13.767 --> 01:16.133
[car lock beeps]
[车锁蜂鸣声]

01:16.133 --> 01:18.533
[indistinct conversations]
[模糊的对话]

01:18.533 --> 01:20.533
- Hi, Pearl.
- Hey, girl!
- 嗨，珍珠。
- 嘿，女孩！

01:20.533 --> 01:23.067
Let's hang out!
- Ugh, I can't.
我们出去玩吧！
- 呃，我不能。

01:23.067 --> 01:25.700
I have to work
at Hot Dog on a String today.
我必须工作
今天在串热狗。

01:25.700 --> 01:29.367
Brad called in sick, so I'm
in charge of stringing the dogs.
布拉德请了病假，所以我
负责给狗串绳。

01:29.367 --> 01:31.133
Totally lame.
完全蹩脚。

01:31.133 --> 01:33.967
- I guess
I'll see you later then.
- 我猜
那我稍后见。

01:33.967 --> 01:35.533
- Uh...
- 呃...

01:35.533 --> 01:38.633
Can I get one with,
uh, extra string?
我可以买一个吗
呃，额外的绳子？

01:38.633 --> 01:41.167
- Ugh.
- 呃。

01:41.167 --> 01:42.233
[heavy metal guitar tones]
[重金属吉他音色]

01:42.233 --> 01:43.367
[phone screaming]
[电话尖叫声]

01:43.367 --> 01:45.433
- What?
- Hey, girl!
- 什么？
- 嘿，女孩！

01:45.433 --> 01:48.300
Want to come over and make fun
of boys or something?
想过来玩玩
男孩什么的？

01:48.300 --> 01:51.067
- Uh, sorry, girl,
I can't.
- 呃，对不起，女孩，
我不能。

01:51.067 --> 01:53.200
I'm working at Scorched Coral
all day.
我在焦珊瑚工作
一整天。

01:53.200 --> 01:54.867
It's heinous.
真是令人发指。

01:54.867 --> 01:56.067
- Oh!
[laughs]
- 哦！
[笑]

01:56.067 --> 01:59.133
So heinous.
See ya later.
太令人发指了。
稍后见。

01:59.133 --> 02:01.067
- See ya later, Pearl.
- 再见，珀尔。

02:01.067 --> 02:03.200
- How much is this choker?
- 这个颈链多少钱？

02:03.200 --> 02:05.333
- Um, it's a wrist band.
- 嗯，这是一个腕带。

02:05.333 --> 02:07.467
- [gasping and choking]
- [喘气和窒息]

02:07.467 --> 02:09.400
- Awesome.
- 惊人的。

02:09.400 --> 02:11.567
[light instrumental music]
[轻音乐]

02:11.567 --> 02:13.133
[phone rings]
- Nixie speaking.
[电话铃声]
- 尼克西讲话。

02:13.133 --> 02:17.900
- Nixie! My bestest friend
in the whole wide world.
- 尼克西！我最好的朋友
在整个世界。

02:17.900 --> 02:19.233
You should come over.
你应该过来。

02:19.233 --> 02:22.233
We can watch TV
and eat cheese!
我们可以看电视
并吃奶酪！

02:22.233 --> 02:23.600
- I wish I could, Pearl,
- 我希望我可以，珍珠，

02:23.600 --> 02:25.700
but I have to work
at Dangles and Bangles.
但我必须工作
在吊坠和手镯。

02:25.700 --> 02:28.533
All dangles are half off with
the purchase of any bangle.
所有吊坠均半价
购买任何手镯。

02:28.533 --> 02:30.600
Dangle must be of equal
or lesser value than bangle.
悬垂必须相等
或价值低于手镯。

02:30.600 --> 02:32.667
Some restrictions may apply.
可能存在一些限制。

02:34.833 --> 02:39.167
- Oh, you don't work
at the mall, do you, Derek?
-哦，你不工作
德里克，你在商场吗？

02:39.167 --> 02:42.100
- No, but all my girlfriends do.
- 不，但我所有的女朋友都这样。

02:42.100 --> 02:44.433
[ding]
[叮]

02:44.433 --> 02:47.400
- Daddy!
Guess what?
- 爸爸！
你猜怎么着？

02:47.400 --> 02:48.600
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:48.600 --> 02:51.167
[muttering frantically]
[疯狂地嘀咕]

02:51.167 --> 02:53.767
[chuckles]
I have no idea, Pearly.
[笑声]
我不知道，珀莉。

02:53.767 --> 02:56.800
- Dad, I'm getting a job today.
- 爸爸，我今天找到工作了。

02:56.800 --> 02:58.067
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

02:58.067 --> 03:00.067
Yahoo!
雅虎！

03:00.067 --> 03:03.600
Oh, this is great news,
Pearl, me dear!
哦，这是个好消息，
珍珠，亲爱的！

03:03.600 --> 03:05.733
Now instead of wasting
my precious money
现在而不是浪费
我的宝贵金钱

03:05.733 --> 03:08.767
on your "clothes"
and your "school supplies"...
在你的“衣服”上
还有你的“学习用品”...

03:08.767 --> 03:11.467
[chuckles]
You can waste your own.
[笑声]
你可以浪费你自己的。

03:11.467 --> 03:13.600
- I'll be a independent
working woman,
- 我会成为一个独立的人
职业女性，

03:13.600 --> 03:17.267
blazing my own trail and
standing on my own two fins.
开辟自己的道路并
靠自己的两个鳍站立。

03:17.267 --> 03:18.667
- That's the spirit.
- 这就是精神。

03:18.667 --> 03:20.400
- Oh, can I borrow $10?
- 哦，我可以借 10 美元吗？

03:20.400 --> 03:22.400
[cash register chimes]
[收银机铃声]

03:22.400 --> 03:24.067
- I'll miss you
around the house.
- 我会想念你的
房子周围。

03:24.067 --> 03:26.600
- Oh, Daddy, you'll see me
after work.
- 哦，爸爸，你会看到我的
下班后。

03:26.600 --> 03:28.733
- I was talkin' to the money.
- 我是在和钱说话。

03:30.067 --> 03:31.367
- Hey, Marina!
- 嘿，玛丽娜！

03:31.367 --> 03:33.467
I'm here to apply for a job.
我来这里是为了申请工作。

03:33.467 --> 03:36.467
- You should meet the manager,
I guess?
- 你应该见见经理
我猜？

03:36.467 --> 03:37.933
He's in his office.
他在他的办公室里。

03:37.933 --> 03:43.067
Mr. Pepalino, there's someone
here for a job.
佩帕利诺先生，有人
来这里找工作。

03:43.067 --> 03:44.400
- Ah!
- 啊！

03:44.400 --> 03:46.167
- [straining]
- [紧张]

03:46.167 --> 03:49.767
- [grunting and groaning]
- [咕哝和呻吟]

03:49.767 --> 03:51.533
I-I don't think he's in there.
我-我不认为他在里面。

03:51.533 --> 03:53.900
- [muffled moaning]
- [低沉的呻吟声]

03:53.900 --> 03:57.400
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

03:57.400 --> 04:01.367
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:01.367 --> 04:05.067
[gargling]
[漱口]

04:05.067 --> 04:06.933
[steam hissing]
[蒸汽嘶嘶声]

04:08.500 --> 04:10.600
We're not hiring.
我们不招聘。

04:11.600 --> 04:13.167
[heavy metal guitar tones]
[重金属吉他音色]

04:13.167 --> 04:16.067
- Welcome to Scorched Coral.
Please go away.
- 欢迎来到焦珊瑚。
请走开。

04:16.067 --> 04:18.733
Oh, hey, Pearl.
What are you doing here?
哦，嘿，珀尔。
你在这里做什么？

04:18.733 --> 04:21.667
- I would like to apply
for a job, please.
- 我想申请
为了一份工作，请。

04:21.667 --> 04:24.067
- Yeah, sorry.
You're a little late.
- 是的，抱歉。
你来晚了一点。

04:24.067 --> 04:27.700
We were hiring, but we actually
just hired someone today.
我们正在招聘，但实际上我们
今天刚雇了一个人。

04:27.700 --> 04:29.467
- [hissing and growling]
- [嘶嘶声和咆哮声]

04:29.467 --> 04:30.900
- Ah!
- 啊！

04:32.267 --> 04:35.667
Oh, Nixie, I need to work
at Dangles and Bangles.
哦，尼克西，我需要工作
在吊坠和手镯。

04:35.667 --> 04:38.400
This is my last chance.
You gotta help me out here.
这是我最后的机会了。
你得帮我一下。

04:38.400 --> 04:40.600
Oh, please, please, please,
please, please!
哦，拜托，拜托，拜托，
拜托，拜托！

04:40.600 --> 04:42.933
- Come on, let me introduce you
to the manager.
- 来吧，我给你介绍一下
给经理。

04:44.433 --> 04:46.233
- This is--
- Nope, not hiring.
- 这是--
- 不，不是招聘。

04:46.233 --> 04:49.067
- You don't understand.
I have to work here!
- 你不明白。
我必须在这里工作！

04:49.067 --> 04:52.300
- Sorry, missy, the only thing
we don't dangle here
- 对不起，小姐，唯一的事情
我们不在这里晃荡

04:52.300 --> 04:54.067
is hope.
是希望。

04:54.067 --> 04:55.500
- Oh, bangles.
- 哦，手镯。

04:56.567 --> 04:59.767
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

04:59.767 --> 05:01.767
Ah...
啊...

05:04.333 --> 05:06.067
[belches]
[打嗝]

05:07.200 --> 05:09.567
Oh, this is the worst.
哦，这是最糟糕的。

05:09.567 --> 05:11.300
If I don't get a job
at the mall,
如果我找不到工作
在商场，

05:11.300 --> 05:14.533
I'm gonna have to hang out
with my dad.
我得出去玩
和我爸爸。

05:14.533 --> 05:15.933
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:15.933 --> 05:17.867
- You looking for a job,
deary?
- 你正在寻找工作，
亲爱的？

05:17.867 --> 05:20.567
- Yeah!
I need one as soon as possible.
- 是的！
我尽快需要一个。

05:20.567 --> 05:23.100
It's a life or death situation,
actually.
这是生死攸关的情况
实际上。

05:23.100 --> 05:24.667
- Oh, my goodness.
- 哦，我的天啊。

05:24.667 --> 05:26.067
Are you in danger?
你有危险吗？

05:26.067 --> 05:27.633
- In danger
of never seeing my friends
- 处于危险之中
从未见过我的朋友

05:27.633 --> 05:29.500
'cause I don't have a job.
因为我没有工作。

05:29.500 --> 05:31.533
- Come with me.
- 跟我来。

05:35.700 --> 05:36.767
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

05:36.767 --> 05:38.500
- [gasps]
Weird.
- [喘气]
奇怪。

05:38.500 --> 05:41.767
[alarm blaring]
[whistle blowing]
[警报声]
[吹口哨]

05:41.767 --> 05:45.900
I've never been in this part
of the mall before.
我从来没有参与过这部分
之前的商场。

05:47.067 --> 05:48.600
[gasps]
Ugh!
[喘气]
呃！

05:48.600 --> 05:50.167
What's that smell?
那是什么味道？

05:50.167 --> 05:53.633
- Oh, probably one of the many
perfumes that we sell
- 哦，可能是众多之一
我们销售的香水

05:53.633 --> 05:56.767
here at Grandma's Apron!
这里是奶奶的围裙！

05:58.400 --> 06:01.167
Congratulations!
You're hired.
恭喜！
你被录用了。

06:01.167 --> 06:02.300
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:02.300 --> 06:06.267
Oh, this is the best day
of my life!
哦，这是最好的一天
我的生活！

06:06.267 --> 06:07.800
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

06:07.800 --> 06:09.300
Ah!
[back pops]
啊!
[回弹]

06:09.300 --> 06:12.667
Well, I can't quite afford
to be picky these days.
好吧，我买不起
这些天变得挑剔。

06:12.667 --> 06:16.133
The only other employee
besides me was Myrtle,
唯一的另一名员工
除了我之外还有默特尔，

06:16.133 --> 06:20.667
and she's...no longer with us.
她……不再和我们在一起了。

06:20.667 --> 06:23.800
- [shrieks]
Almost forgot my shades!
- [尖叫]
差点忘记我的墨镜了！

06:24.867 --> 06:27.067
See ya later, suckers!
待会儿见，傻瓜们！

06:27.067 --> 06:28.667
[laughing]
[笑]

06:30.900 --> 06:33.400
- Hey, Pearl.
Over here.
- 嘿，珀尔。
在这里。

06:33.400 --> 06:34.800
- Did you find a job?
- 你找到工作了吗？

06:34.800 --> 06:39.167
- Yeah, I got a job
at Grandma's Apron.
- 是的，我找到了工作
在奶奶的围裙处。

06:39.167 --> 06:43.667
- [laughing]
Pearl, you can not be serious.
- [笑]
珍珠，你不是认真的吧。

06:43.667 --> 06:45.900
- Ew, that store is
for old people.
- 呃，那家商店是
对于老人来说。

06:45.900 --> 06:49.933
- [laughing]
Old people are so...old.
- [笑]
老人们都这么……老了。

06:49.933 --> 06:52.267
- Old people aren't that bad.
- 老年人没那么坏。

06:52.267 --> 06:53.933
Are they?
他们是吗？

06:55.767 --> 06:57.667
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

06:57.667 --> 06:59.067
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

06:59.067 --> 07:01.133
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:04.533 --> 07:07.533
[ragtime music]
[拉格泰姆音乐]

07:07.533 --> 07:09.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:09.600 --> 07:12.833
- Hey, girls,
I smell moth balls.
- 嘿，女孩们，
我闻到了樟脑丸的味道。

07:12.833 --> 07:14.733
- Well, we are having a sale
on them.
- 嗯，我们正在促销
在他们身上。

07:14.733 --> 07:16.300
They're 25% off today.
今天他们有 25% 的折扣。

07:16.300 --> 07:18.800
- Um, isn't it
your nap time, Pearl?
- 嗯，不是吗
你午睡时间到了吗，珀尔？

07:18.800 --> 07:21.467
- Where's your muumuu, granny?
- 你的muumuu在哪里，奶奶？

07:21.467 --> 07:24.267
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:24.267 --> 07:27.400
- Oh, don't let those
bubble-headed nincompoops
- 哦，别让那些
泡泡头傻瓜

07:27.400 --> 07:28.667
get to you, Pearly.
去找你，珀莉。

07:28.667 --> 07:30.767
- But it's not fair.
- 但这不公平。

07:30.767 --> 07:33.067
- Life's not fair, my dear.
- 生活是不公平的，亲爱的。

07:33.067 --> 07:35.733
We all go through hard times
at some point.
我们都会经历困难时期
在某个时刻。

07:35.733 --> 07:37.700
Here, look.
See?
在这里，看。
看？

07:37.700 --> 07:39.800
I was different
from the other girls,
我是不同的
从其他女孩那里，

07:39.800 --> 07:41.633
and they teased me for it.
他们因此取笑我。

07:41.633 --> 07:44.167
They called me
"Boring Beatrice."
他们打电话给我
“无聊的贝阿特丽斯。”

07:44.167 --> 07:46.967
Not very creative, those girls.
[chuckles]
那些女孩们不太有创意。
[笑声]

07:46.967 --> 07:49.067
- Who would even
take a picture of that?
- 谁会甚至
拍张照片吗？

07:49.067 --> 07:53.067
- Oh, good ol' Jonesy
from the AV Club took that one!
- 噢，好样的琼斯
从 AV 俱乐部拿走了那一张！

07:53.067 --> 07:54.767
- Wait, but who took
that picture--
- 等等，但是谁拿走了
那张照片——

07:54.767 --> 07:56.867
- All that matters,
Pearly, my dear,
- 重要的是，
珍珠般的，亲爱的，

07:56.867 --> 07:59.433
is that things will soon change.
事情很快就会改变。

07:59.433 --> 08:00.767
But in the meantime,
但与此同时，

08:00.767 --> 08:03.067
you should be having
as much fun as possible.
你应该有
尽可能多的乐趣。

08:03.067 --> 08:06.067
Let me show you
how grandmas do it.
让我告诉你
奶奶们是怎么做的。

08:07.233 --> 08:10.233
[jazz music]
[爵士乐]

08:10.233 --> 08:18.167
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:27.500 --> 08:29.667
[explosion]
[爆炸]

08:29.667 --> 08:32.433
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:32.433 --> 08:34.433
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:34.433 --> 08:38.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:38.067 --> 08:41.400
- Whoa, come back here, yarn!
- 哇哦，回来吧，纱线！

08:41.400 --> 08:42.533
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:42.533 --> 08:43.533
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

08:43.533 --> 08:45.100
[dramatic tones]
[戏剧性的语气]

08:45.100 --> 08:48.200
- [laughing]
Love the shoes, Pearl.
- [笑]
喜欢这双鞋，珍珠。

08:48.200 --> 08:50.067
- You guys just don't get it.
=> - 你们只是不明白。

08:50.067 --> 08:52.167
Being a grandma is fun.
当奶奶很有趣。

08:52.167 --> 08:54.633
I get to sit
in a rocking chair,
我可以坐下来
坐在摇椅上，

08:54.633 --> 08:56.300
dust tchotchkes,
灰尘小玩意，

08:56.300 --> 08:57.500
bake cookies,
烤饼干，

08:57.500 --> 09:00.233
knit mittens,
hats, and scarves.
针织手套，
帽子、围巾。

09:00.233 --> 09:02.500
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:02.500 --> 09:04.200
- Scarves.
- 围巾。

09:04.200 --> 09:07.500
- It's actually, like, the most
coral store in the whole mall,
- 这实际上是最
整个商场的珊瑚店，

09:07.500 --> 09:13.233
so you can all just...just...
eat barnacles!
所以你们都可以只是...只是...
吃藤壶！

09:13.233 --> 09:15.133
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:15.133 --> 09:18.500
- Now, now, girls.
Let's be polite.
- 现在，现在，女孩们。
我们要有礼貌。

09:18.500 --> 09:22.467
- What are you gonna do
about it, granny?
-你要做什么
关于这件事，奶奶？

09:22.467 --> 09:25.467
[grunting menacingly]
[威胁地咕哝]

09:25.467 --> 09:27.667
- Granny power!
- 奶奶的力量！

09:27.667 --> 09:29.633
[echoing]
Power! Power!
[回声]
力量！力量！

09:29.633 --> 09:30.633
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

09:30.633 --> 09:31.767
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

09:31.767 --> 09:35.367
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:35.367 --> 09:36.633
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

09:36.633 --> 09:39.533
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:39.533 --> 09:43.200
- Pearl, toss me
the Autumn Years perfume.
- 珍珠，扔给我吧
秋季香水。

09:43.200 --> 09:44.533
- Hi-ya!
- 嗨呀！

09:44.533 --> 09:49.467
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:49.467 --> 09:51.333
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:51.333 --> 09:54.200
- It smells like pills
and bed pans.
- 闻起来像药丸
和便盆。

09:54.200 --> 09:55.400
Whoa!
哇！

09:55.400 --> 10:00.733
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:00.733 --> 10:03.533
- [laughing]
- [笑]

10:03.533 --> 10:06.467
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:06.467 --> 10:08.200
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

10:09.767 --> 10:12.133
- Well, now that
you're all sitting down,
- 好吧，现在
你们都坐下了

10:12.133 --> 10:13.933
let me tell you
about the first time
让我告诉你
关于第一次

10:13.933 --> 10:16.167
I ever saw a talking
picture show.
我曾经见过一个会说话的人
图片展示。

10:16.167 --> 10:19.000
Oh, boy, did they know
how to talk.
哦，天哪，他们知道吗
怎样说话。

10:19.000 --> 10:22.033
- No, please!
I can't take any more!
- 不，拜托！
我再也受不了了！

10:22.033 --> 10:24.933
- It's... so...boring.
- 这……太……无聊了。

10:24.933 --> 10:27.067
- No, I hate the past.
- 不，我讨厌过去。

10:29.000 --> 10:33.267
- And that's why today,
we all wear shoes.
- 这就是为什么今天，
我们都穿鞋。

10:33.267 --> 10:35.733
- Okay, okay,
We get it.
- 好吧，好吧，
我们明白了。

10:35.733 --> 10:37.933
We will stop being mean,
I promise.
我们将不再卑鄙，
我保证。

10:37.933 --> 10:40.267
Just let us go.
让我们走吧。

10:41.567 --> 10:43.600
all: Whoa!
全体：哇！

10:43.600 --> 10:45.300
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

10:45.300 --> 10:46.767
- Listen, Pearl.
- 听着，珀尔。

10:46.767 --> 10:48.633
We didn't mean to hurt
your feeling or anything.
我们无意伤害
你的感觉或者什么。

10:48.633 --> 10:50.900
We just, like, think it's weird
that you're, like,
我们只是觉得这很奇怪
你就像

10:50.900 --> 10:53.733
a grandma now or whatever.
现在已经是奶奶了或者什么的。

10:53.733 --> 10:55.767
We don't really get it.
我们真的不明白。

10:55.767 --> 10:58.867
- Well, I don't care
what you think anymore anyway.
- 好吧，我不在乎
无论如何，你怎么想？

10:58.867 --> 11:00.600
I'm being true to myself,
我忠于自己，

11:00.600 --> 11:04.267
and--and that's all
that matters!
以及——仅此而已
这很重要！

11:04.267 --> 11:05.400
all: Eh.
全体：呃。

11:07.067 --> 11:09.767
- I'm a grandma now.
Right, Beatrice?
- 我现在是奶奶了。
对吧，比阿特丽斯？

11:09.767 --> 11:14.267
- Oh, Pearl, I'm so glad
you enjoy being a grandma,
- 哦，珍珠，我很高兴
你享受当奶奶的乐趣

11:14.267 --> 11:16.767
but your friends
make a good point.
但你的朋友
提出一个好观点。

11:16.767 --> 11:19.133
You're only young once, you see.
你知道，你的青春只有一次。

11:19.133 --> 11:21.467
You don't want
to grow up too fast
你不想要
成长得太快

11:21.467 --> 11:24.833
or you'll miss out
on all the fun.
否则你会错过
一切的乐趣。

11:24.833 --> 11:27.067
- I guess you're right.
- 我想你是对的。

11:27.067 --> 11:29.333
Being a grandma is nice and all,
当奶奶真是太好了

11:29.333 --> 11:32.367
but I do miss
being a super hip young person.
但我确实想念
是一个超级时髦的年轻人。

11:32.367 --> 11:35.533
- Go have yourself some fun,
my dear.
- 去玩玩吧
亲爱的。

11:35.533 --> 11:37.067
Ah, ah, ah, ah.
啊啊啊啊啊。

11:37.067 --> 11:40.067
How 'bout a nice,
gentle handshake instead?
怎么样一个漂亮的，
而是温柔地握手？

11:40.067 --> 11:42.233
[groans]
- Hey, wait up, guys!
[呻吟]
- 嘿，等等，伙计们！

11:42.233 --> 11:45.100
I want to be friends
while I'm still young!
我想成为朋友
趁我还年轻！

11:45.100 --> 11:48.467
- I'll see you tomorrow.
- 明天见。

11:48.467 --> 11:50.067
- You dropped this.
- 你把这个掉了。

- 你把这个掉了。